 for a relationship.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":321.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":141.0,"r":540.3333333333334,"t":370.3333333333333},"charspan":[0,324],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/25","text":"Important: When the copy direction is switched, it is crucial that no outstanding I/O exists to the volume that changes from primary to secondary because all of the I/O is inhibited to that volume when it becomes the secondary. Therefore, careful planning is required before you switch the copy direction for a relationship."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"To switch the direction of a remote copy relationship; complete the following steps:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":291.6666666666667,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":135.66666666666666,"r":503.0,"t":306.3333333333333},"charspan":[0,84],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/26","text":"To switch the direction of a remote copy relationship; complete the following steps:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","enumerated":false,"label":"list_item","marker":"","orig":"1 Open the Copy Services Remote panel. Copy","parent":{"$ref":"#/groups/0"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":273.7064766664729,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":137.66666666666666,"r":386.6666666666667,"t":289.6268566668605},"charspan":[0,43],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/27","text":"1 Open the Copy Services Remote panel. Copy"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","enumerated":false,"label":"list_item","marker":"","orig":"2 Right-click the relationship to be switched and select Switch; as shown in Figure 11-141.","parent":{"$ref":"#/groups/0"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":257.66666666666663,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":136.0,"r":544.3333333333334,"t":272.0},"charspan":[0,91],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/28","text":"2 Right-click the relationship to be switched and select Switch; as shown in Figure 11-141."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"caption","orig":"Figure 11-141 Switching remot